OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer guilty of raping
OL,4,Ateenage girl and woman in Shetland
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe 32-year-old had denied the offences
OL,7,Fbut was found guilty by a jury
OL,8,Ffollowing a trial at the High Court in
OL,9,FEdinburgh. He will be sentenced on 8
OL,10,FDecember.
